OL,3,GNEWSAEmotional reunions as photographer
OL,4,Arecreates 1980 shots
OL,5,
OL,6,FBack in 1980, photography student Sam
OL,7,FHill roamed the streets of Preston
OL,8,Flooking for young people who stood out
OL,9,F- the mods, the punks, the free
OL,10,Fspirits.
OL,12,FHe would stop them, take their picture,
OL,13,Fand move on.
OL,15,F"I think I caught a special
OL,16,Fgeneration," said Sam.
OL,18,F"A lot of free-spirited young people. I
OL,19,Fnever asked their names.
